              "blocks": {
                "text_EgFUCd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>To prevent tarnishing, store your bracelets in a dry, cool place away from moisture and chemicals. Regular cleaning with a polishing cloth designed for the metal will also help maintain their shine.</p>",
