                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, bracelet layering is a popular trend. You can mix different metals and styles to create a unique, personalized look. Try combining chain bracelets, bangles, and cuffs for a fashionable, stacked effect.</p>",
