                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>White Gold is more durable and resistant to tarnish than Silver. It is also often coated with rhodium for a brilliant finish. Silver, on the other hand, is a more affordable option, but may require more frequent cleaning to maintain its luster.</p>",
